    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "顶点是A，B，C的三角形，记作“ "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A B C ^ { \\prime \\prime }"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "，读作“三角形 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "A B C ^ { \\prime \\prime }"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A B C"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "的三边有时也用a，b，c来表示.如图13.1-1，顶点A所对的边BC用a表示，顶点B所对的边AC用b表示，顶点C所对的边AB用c表示."
          }
        ]
      },
